        {
          "unit_index": 16,
          "verse": 5,
          "content_chars": 19,
          "text": "5 然后着 __PERSON_F__ 对他们说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 57,
          "verse": 14,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "巴多罗买位，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 61,
          "verse": 15,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "被称为奋锐党西门，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 71,
          "verse": 19,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "医位治了所有人。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 80,
          "verse": 21,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "欢笑你们将会。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 82,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 25,
          "text": "22 当人们因人子恨你们、排斥你们着、辱骂你们、并恶言骂你们时，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 95,
          "verse": 25,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "将要悲哀因为你们哭泣。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 102,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "爱你们着的敌人，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 106,
          "verse": 29,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "29 你的右脸若有人打，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 109,
          "verse": 29,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "连些内衣也不要拒绝他。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 111,
          "verse": 30,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "若有人拿了你的物件，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 126,
          "verse": 35,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "35 但你们要敌人爱你们的，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 138,
          "verse": 37,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "不要定罪人些，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 143,
          "verse": 38,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "就必有给了你们的，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 167,
          "verse": 43,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "坏树不能结果过子好。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 169,
          "verse": 44,
          "content_chars": 11,
          "text": "人不从荆棘上摘无花了果，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 172,
          "verse": 45,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "发出善些；"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 193,
          "verse": 49,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "没有个根基。"
        }
      ]
    },
